{"path":"README.md","ref":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":1,"text":"<p align=\"center\"><img src=\"docs/logo.png\" alt=\"Relay logo, now green\" width=\"96\"></p>"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":3,"text":"# Relay"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":5,"text":"Relay moves jobs from a queue to workers. It retries a failed job five times with a longer wait each time, then parks it."},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":7,"text":"<details>"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":8,"text":"<summary>Why not a cron job?</summary>"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":9,"text":""},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":10,"text":"A cron job cannot see that a worker died. Relay does, and gives the job to another worker in under a second."},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":12,"text":"</details>"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":14,"text":"## Install"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":15,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":16,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":17,"text":"npm install relay"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":18,"text":"```"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":19,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":20,"text":"## Use"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":21,"text":""},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":22,"text":"Create a queue, then start a worker. Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>C</kbd> to stop it. <sub>The worker finishes its job first.</sub>"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":24,"text":"```ts"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":25,"text":"import { createQueue } from \"relay\";"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":26,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":27,"text":"const queue = createQueue({"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":28,"text":"  name: \"mail\","},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":29,"text":"  retries: 5,"},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":30,"text":"  backoff: \"exponential\","},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":31,"text":"  maxWaitMs: 60_000,"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":32,"text":"});"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":34,"text":"queue.add({ to: \"team@example.com\" });"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":35,"text":"```"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":36,"text":""},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":37,"text":"Check the queue from the shell:"},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":38,"text":""},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":39,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":40,"text":"relay status mail"},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":41,"text":"relay parked mail --since 1h"},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":42,"text":"```"},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":43,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":44,"text":"The config file is JSON:"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":45,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":46,"text":"```json"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":47,"text":"{ \"workers\": 4, \"park\": true }"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":48,"text":"```"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":49,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":50,"text":"![Architecture](docs/arch.png)"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":51,"text":""},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":52,"text":"See the [API notes](docs/api.md), the [install steps](#install) and the [changelog](https://example.com/changelog). The [retry guide](docs/retry.md) is new."},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":53,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":54,"text":"<!-- keep this list short -->"},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":55,"text":""},{"sha":"58e78d97ae799b828addec2375c1bce324dc7628","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"base","line":56,"text":"- Jobs run at least once."},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":57,"text":"- A parked job waits for a person, and the dashboard lists it."},{"sha":"25b251bcd2a97bf6f3ad865e15484368adbcc19f","author":"Fixture","timestamp":1794374652,"summary":"change","line":58,"text":"- Each retry waits twice as long as the one before."}]}
